  m_Name: Part_docking_hatch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OrionAR.PartInfo
  partId: docking_hatch
  displayName: Forward Docking Hatch
  shortName: Docking Hatch
  zone: 1
  order: 170
  keySpec: Overhead crew transfer tunnel
  summary: The hatch above the cabin, leading to the docking adapter. This is the
    route the crew take to transfer into Gateway or a lunar lander once docked.
  whyItMatters: "Before it can be opened, the crew pressurise the tunnel between
    the two hatches and watch it hold, confirming a good seal before committing.
    In microgravity an overhead hatch is no harder to use than a side one \u2014
    orientation inside a spacecraft is a matter of convention, not gravity."
  narration: {fileID: 0}
